Z||000000||sdm1964||02-27-2000||09:19 PM||||What a week. I noticed that driving back from atlanta it she was running a little warm. I pulled that radiator to be rotted out, when i started it up to pull in the drive way i heard an exaust leak. I pulled the back manifold and it had a crack, got that fixed , took me 4 hours to try to get the bottom bolt by the ac compressor on. I finally pulled down the compressor, I also put in a new water pump, belts and rear brakes. Finally got it all together and went to take it for a test drive and had dash or exterior lights,Ran into town and got a new headlight switch, NOT IT, HINT don't look at fuses in the dark, replaced the fuse this morning. I was not ready to drop all that money this weekend but am getting new tires tommorrow, so now that i am broke i guess i will hang out here for a while!!!  LOL Seems to start out as a little project and ends up taking up 3 days. Does this happen to you guys too?||||reg||9
